5. BUILD A LEAK-FREE DEFCON DATASET
==================================================

Create a historical per-player-fixture dataset.

One row:

(season, gameweek, fixture_id, player_id)

Target:

DEFCON = 1
if player reached the FPL defensive-contribution threshold in that match.

DEFCON = 0 otherwise.

For defenders:

CBIT >= 10

For midfielders/forwards:

CBIRT >= 12

where recoveries are included for MID/FWD according to 2026/27 rules.

The target must represent the actual FPL award, not a continuous number of points.

