13. 2026/27 BPS
==================================================

Audit the existing Bonus model against the official 2026/27 BPS changes.

The 2026/27 BPS changes include:

- players are no longer penalized for being tackled
- CBI contribution to BPS changed from 1 BPS per 2 CBI to 1 BPS per 3 CBI
- changes were made to reduce overlap between defensive contribution points and bonus points
- changes aim to improve bonus potential for goalkeepers, full-backs and attacking players

Do NOT blindly train/deploy a new Bonus ML model in Phase 3C.

Instead:

1. audit current Bonus assumptions
2. verify compatibility with 2026/27
3. document required changes
4. leave Bonus ML for the dedicated future phase unless the existing architecture makes a small compatibility fix necessary.

